{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2022-08-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. ANNOUNCES 3RD QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY , AUG. 19, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC.\xa0(THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: EXR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY\'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A THIRD QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND OF $1.50 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY.\xa0 THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 30, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2022.'}